-- differ-before: use/setup.shale
-- differ-mounts: use/lane.mounts
-- differ-argv: book:r.shale
-- differ-argv: scratch:lanes/x/r.shale
-- A recipe and its library, as a mount's checkout has them (`book:`), and
-- a lane's copy of both (`scratch:lanes/x`), whose library says otherwise.
-- The recipes are the same bytes; each loads its own sibling, so the
-- lane's run says "lane" with no mounts of its own. The trees are
-- use/setup.shale's.
